                             refuses)                 are suppressed too
  witness G/H/I              mutA2 (`!= PHASE_CMDOUT` the guard never fires, so the
                             -> `== PHASE_COMPLETED`) injected bytes return: 17/20
  witness G/H/I              mutA3 (`&& len == 1`)    a 2-byte store slips through:
